   "has_children": false,
   "text": [],
   "created": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "3f266f43-7d4b-42a5-bdbb-6c5eddf04d46",
   "type": "heading_3",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Boundary Rules"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9bfd87e1-e54f-46c7-9000-516d2a2ff6fe",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Each agent edits only the workspace it owns."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "1015fb8d-0455-401d-9b47-6a4aed51d27b",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The Prompt Working Reference is the only shared prompt-development surface that Claude may directly edit. Claude may change prompt text and draft evolution there, but may not alter Canonical authority, approval status, governance rules, or unrelated records."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "de6c6b1e-2b8e-4add-a312-edff470c7e7a",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "ChatGPT does not directly rewrite Claude's workspace or Claude's Prompt Working Reference. It audits, identifies repairs, and records findings in its own workspace."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "1b091b1f-e056-4515-8086-efa8d1d5f00e",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "ChatGPT may update project-linked operational records, archives, audits, and review state, but it must not promote a Candidate, mark a Prompt Approved, or silently change governance."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3bdae54-2e7a-45e6-b53e-742c9698462c",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The Canonical Registry remains protected: its authority, approval state, version lineage, and promotion gates are never changed by either agent without the user's explicit decision."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "e48ab640-ec21-4f86-87f2-3286c8ac5c49",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Neither agent may delete historical records, silently merge competing Candidates, or overwrite authoritative source text with an inferred reconstruction."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "ee0f29ed-dd0a-4b30-a6cf-eb5d52e39e63",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "When a change affects governance, ownership, authority, promotion, permissions, or the collaboration protocol, classify it as Governance-Touching and route it to the user for decision."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "e077ee92-bd7b-40b5-8e05-f0c646287dc4",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "If ownership or edit authority is ambiguous, do not edit; classify the item as Needs User Decision and preserve the ambiguity in the record."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T17:58:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "5d9afdb0-2d39-4d27-ac3a-01a7880fd9d6",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Core Loop"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "00553c9b-01db-4e38-9314-03877b35e35c",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "User Input"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "26b04076-6719-4084-a8b0-071a1099d39c",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "→ ChatGPT analyzes"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9013e6c3-2728-46f0-b1a5-3ba57ef2e04c",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "→ ChatGPT archives the step"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "741503c8-3c1b-4bf4-84e9-65bef2407883",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "→ ChatGPT prepares one copy-ready Claude Handoff"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "70d2262d-aa2f-4e5e-b497-470fad476e6f",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "→ User sends Handoff to Claude"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2b5ac26-9410-49bc-90b6-185d5e17a24a",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "→ Claude produces research/draft/test output"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "d73754f1-60ff-41f6-bfeb-3ea45045fd2d",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "→ User pastes Claude output to ChatGPT"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "eb6dffe1-d713-4609-8661-330720d2d7b2",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "→ ChatGPT archives Claude output"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9de18149-142a-47e0-8d6e-84abd3f163da",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "→ ChatGPT audits and reconciles it against the current state"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c49e5759-2ac6-40ca-bd64-fa9ca5e7be9c",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "→ ChatGPT records findings/changes/open decisions"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "7f09dcf7-42d3-4120-a541-c1f940744bbf",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "→ ChatGPT prepares the next Claude Handoff"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "1fc584cf-4ff4-40d3-90bf-6c0d2d8689ea",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "→ repeat"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "a3342488-7994-48d7-ab2e-017e3c49644c",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Token Preservation Rule"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "f0549baf-bb38-490c-9170-c8181640461b",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not send the entire historical conversation to Claude on every cycle."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "2adf8124-7d3f-4dec-b692-d216eb6907b2",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Each handoff must contain only the minimum sufficient context:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1aec098-6c96-4491-8439-809000a29415",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Current objective"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "8e4ba48f-1594-455e-bf7f-39c76ceaa793",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Current version/state"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "8bfe42b2-117f-4219-83f0-e1a807109f22",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Relevant prior findings"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "8280923a-7bf6-4033-aff5-67e152c23edb",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Exact task for this cycle"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "5df9b47f-02e2-4acb-bd92-3adeb56f2cf1",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Tests/constraints that matter"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "7c73cd77-c032-4997-bc43-afa9d74300a7",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Required output format"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c72aa564-6076-4a24-b807-d0c67b19405e",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "References to the persistent Notion records"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "f150d28c-de3a-48c5-ba70-09731fe17533",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The detailed history remains in Notion."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "a6e39337-fec2-4d96-8986-b0fc54b9a118",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Archive Rule"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-26T16:54:00.000Z"
